# A partial etch leaves a slab; the mode spreads sideways and its index lies above the slab index of the etched region.
# Reference: the same grid solved with a sparse eigen-solver in SciPy. Bounds: index of the thin slab and of the full slab.
title Silicon rib 500 nm wide on a 130 nm slab
grid dx=0.025 dy=0.01
window width=4.0 ymin=-1.0 ymax=1.22
layer si 0 0.13
rect si -0.25 0.25 0 0.22
symmetry even
field te
expect neff 2.647155839 2e-8
expect group_index 3.793956871 2e-6
expect confinement 0.737868472 1e-6
expect area 0.210074696 1e-5
expect rms_x 0.211136750 1e-6
expect guided yes
expect cells 17760
expect neff_between 2.414845 2.847782
